      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Esianti: Palace of the Winds [zone=1211]\n**Who:**\n- Sky Orchid Understanding [ _Seneschal of Esianti_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:30:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Golden Ruby and Garnet Ring [item=134608]\n- Windseal [item=134797]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Aalishai: Queen's Chambers [zone=1227]\n- Esianti: Audience with a King [zone=1228]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Dirgeful Ruby Blade [ _Seneschal of Flames_]\n- Heart of Flawless Brass [npc=54585]\n- Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens [npc=54586]\n**Related Quests:**\n- All Hail the King [quest=9267]\n- Brass Palace [quest=9445]\n- Contract of War [quest=9446]\n- Fight Fire [quest=9263]\n- Key to the Kingdom [quest=9264]\n- Palace of Embers [quest=9433]\n- Prisoner's Dilemma [quest=9265]\n- Soldier of Air [quest=9225]\n- Trial of Three (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9281]\n- Trial of the Ashes of Rusted Cliff's Glory (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9335]\n- Trial of the Eternal Cyclone (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9336]\n- Trial of the Speaker's Amphitheater (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9282]\n- Trial of the Wending Ways (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9337]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 4 04:48:35 2018\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Prerequisite Quests: Soldier of Air, Fight Fire, and any one of the Trials of Smoke, Prisoner's Dilemma, Place of Embers, Brass Palace, Key to the Kingdom, Contract of War, and All Hail the King.\nSpeak to Sky Orchid Understanding in Esianti: Palace of the Winds in the center of the city in the middle of the zone.\nYou say, 'Hail, Sky Orchid Understanding'\nSky Orchid Understanding says, 'You are even more of a nuisance than the councilors. If you are here to [continue] your crusade, you know what you need to do.'\nYou say, 'continue'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Royal Visits'.\nSky Orchid Understanding says, 'You must obtain ascent from the queen of the efreeti before you can have your resolution to the war. Even then, I must warn you that these things take time. Take this, it might allow you to get a meeting with her.'\nShe gives you Windseal.\n\n---\n\n3. Get access to the queen of the efreeti. 0/1 Aalishai: Palace of Embers\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** Sky orchid Understanding suggested that you should try to gain ascent to end the war from the queen of the efreeti, Heart of Flawless Brass. She gave you some sort of token that might allow you to get a meeting.\n>\n> If the king has a seneschal, the queen probably does too. See if you can find who that is and get a meeting with the Heart of Flawless Brass.\n\n\n\nGo inside the palace at loc +37, -275 in the corner next to Dirgeful Ruby Blade, so you won't aggro mobs nearby.\n\n\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Dirgeful Ruby Blade'\n\n\n\n\nDirgeful Ruby Blade says, 'Get out of the throne room immediately! You have no [reason] nor right to be here!'\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'reason'\n\n\n\n\nDirgeful Ruby Blade says, 'Reasons in your tiny mortal mind are not reason enough.'\n\n\n\n\nGive him the Windseal.\n\n\n\nYour task 'Royal Visits' has been updated.\n\n\n\n\nDirgeful Ruby Blade looks carefully at the token you have given him. 'A mortal, with the Windseal? Will wonders never cease? I will arrange a meeting for you. Speak with me later and I shall see if the queen is [available].'\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'available'\n\n\n\n\nDirgeful Ruby Blade says, 'Yes, I can grant you only a few minutes. I will escort you in to see her when you are [ready].'\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'ready'\n\n\n\n\nDirgeful Ruby Blade says, 'Be swift, do not waste the queen's time.'\n\n\n\n\nYou have entered Aalishai: Queen's Chambers.\n\n4. Speak with Heart of Flawless Brass and convince her to stop the war. 0/1 Aalishai: Palace of Embers\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** Convincing Heart of Flawless Brass to agree to stop the war. Undoubtedly, as you have discovered from your experience with your jann as a whole, she will want something in exchange for her cooperation. See if you can find out what this is.\n\n\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Heart of Flawless Brass'\n\n\n\n\nHeart of Flawless Brass says, 'So, mortals come even to my very court, bearing a seal from the king of the djinn even. Very well, I have granted you some of my time. Be quick and tell me what you seek.'\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'What would you like in exchange ?'\n\n\n\n\nHeart of Flawless Brass says, 'No, of course you would not know what I desire. You surely must know that anything I desire that I cannot simply gain on my own would be far beyond your ability to acquire. It's not as if you could...' she offers a wicked, twisted grin. 'It's not as if you could waltz into the castle in Aalashia and ask the current king of the djinn to give up something of [value to him]. That would be very amusing, and perhaps even worth what you have asked.'\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'value to him'\n\n\n\n\nYour task 'Royal Visits' has been updated.\n\n\n\n\nHeart of Flawless Brass says, 'Yes, it would have to be something he would not want to part with. After all, you mortals are always seeking epic adventures, are you not? I admit that I have something in mind. He will never part with it, he greatly over values such things. Recover from him a muhbis for me, and I will do as you ask. It is a jeweled ring, with garnets and rubies. He will know which it is. Bring that to me and I will find a way to end the war. Until then, do not return to my palace! Get out, the door will take you out of my palace.'\n\n5. Speak with Moon Serf of the Harmonious Heavens and try to obtain the muhbis. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** You must go back to Esianti and see if you can speak with Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens and get the muhbis that the efreeti queen wants.\n\n\n\nGo back to Sky Orchid Understanding in Esianti.\n\n\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Sky Orchid Understanding'\n\n\n\n\nSky Orchid Understanding says, 'An audience with the king can be arranged, if the need is great. Be clear, however, that your privilege is not unlimited. Tell me when you are [available] and I will see if the king can make time for you.'\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'available'\n\n\n\n\nSky Orchid Understanding says, 'He can see you, but you must be brief. When you are [ready] I shall send you into the chamber.'\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'ready'\n\n\n\n\nSky Orchid Understanding says, 'Be respectful or you will gain little.'\n\n\n\n\nYou have entered Esianti: Audience with a King.\n\n6. Deliver the muhbis to the efreeti queen. Aalishai: Palace of Embers\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens'\n\n\n\n\nMoon Serf of Harmonious Heavens says, 'I remember you. You are the mortal that assisted me with some minor task. What is it that you have come here for?'\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'I came for a ring with garnets and rubies muhbis please'\n\n\n\n\n_If you get no response, zone back out and then speak to Sky Orchid Understanding again to be ported back into the instance. Then speak with Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens again._\n\n\n\nYour task 'Royal Visits' has been updated.\n\n\n\n\nMoon Serf of Harmonious Heavens says, 'You wish, what? This is the thing I must offer in order to have peace? You can never understand the cost I paid for that, or whom it contains.' Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens pauses and considers. When he speaks again he seems resigned. 'I shall pay the price, though the cost to me is nothing compared to the cost to the one inside the ring. Be wary of this muhbis, for it contains a clever and dangerous creature, far too complex for a mortal to deal with. Once it is in your hands you must begone from here. I do not wish to see you again. Leave through the door and do not return.'\n\n\n\n\nYou receive Golden Ruby and Garnet Ring [item=134608].\n\n\n\nHead back to Aalishai; Queen's Chambers for another audience with the queen.\n\n\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Heart of Flawless Brass'\n\n\n\n\nHeart of Flawless Brass says, 'Ah, you have returned to report failure and beg me to end our contract. I could be induced to do so, should you be able to provide me something worthwhile.'\n\n\n\n\nGive her the Golden Ruby and Garnet Ring.\n\n\n\nHeart of Flawless Brass says, 'What, you have the muhbis? Well, that is indeed a surprise. Either you mortals are smarter than you seem, or Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens has grown weak. I am certain it is the latter. I shall honor my end of the contract, the war shall end, eventually.' the queen smiles wryly, 'as promised.'\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n\n\n\nReward(s):\n\n\n212 platinum 5 gold\n\n\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 212 pp, 5 gold, Experience",
